ref=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,I,\\mathfrak A_\\bullet=\\langle\\mathfrak A_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(U,I,\\mathfrak A_\\bullet=\\langle\\mathfrak A_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet))\\)</span> types the indexed family (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\)</span> is the ultrafilter predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the common-language structure predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\">\\(\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\\)</span> is the ultraproduct structure (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"77610c949b2c174a\" href=\"?note=77610c949b2c174a\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-ultraproduct.md\">../batch16/58-df-ultraproduct.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,U)\\leftrightarrow \\exists I,\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet))\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathfrak A=\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicUltraproductStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,U)\\leftrightarrow \\exists I,\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak A_\\bullet))\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathfrak A=\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{